Manually execute a task inside a target
directory with its .cronrc environment

Usage:
  cron-person task run <dir>
  <command...> [flags]

Arguments:
  <dir>
    Directory path containing .cronrc
  <command...>
    Shell command string to execute

Flags:
  -h, --help   help for run

Global Flags:
      --config string
        Path to custom configuration
        file (default:
        $XDG_CONFIG_HOME/cron-person/config.json)
      --store string
        Path to custom authorization
        state file (default:
        $XDG_STATE_HOME/cron-person/allowed.json)
